engineering|Broad technical design/building field not limited to machines. Bridge aspiration remains a hope, not guaranteed safety; Vietnamese study and intention align without verified domain taxonomy.
inadvertent|Unintentional change is not necessarily minor or harmless. Address alteration and different street preserved; the standalone Vietnamese gloss does not imply deliberate negligence.
nod|Agreement signal and sleepy dropping are separate supported ordinals. Instructions and bus scene match each meaning; nod off is only a related construction, not automatically an approved new phrasal Lexeme.
throne|Ceremonial chair boundary fits carved seat and hall. Vietnamese ngai vàng is idiomatic and does not assert the chair contains gold; royal authority use remains recorded as not covered here.
width|Across-side measurement distinguished from length and depth. Doorway-before-desk instruction translates direction and sequence faithfully; uncountable property with specific measurement construction checked.
